	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="2">Space Shuttle Columbia Apparently Breaks Apart in Flames Over Texas Minutes Before Scheduled Landing</td>
		<td valign="top" rowspan="3" width="95" class="imagecredit8"><a href="/news/data/3_ds_5001.asp"><img src="/dsdsmultimedia/photos/SPACE_SHUTTLE56.jpg" width="85" border="0"></a></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="2" class="citation8">Space shuttle Columbia apparently broke apart in flames as it streaked over Texas toward its scheduled landing Saturday, killing all seven astronauts, six Americans and an Israeli.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/3_ds_5001.asp">Full Story</a>
		</td>
	</tr>
