	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="2">U.S. Says It Has No Information Terrorism Involved As Space Shuttle Apparently Disintegrates</td>
		<td valign="top" rowspan="3" width="95" class="imagecredit8"><a href="/news/data/3_ds_4945.asp"><img src="/dsdsmultimedia/photos/SPACE_SHUTTLE50.jpg" width="85" border="0"></a></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="2" class="citation8">Bush administration officials said they had no immediate information Saturday that terrorism was involved as NASA lost contact with the space shuttle Columbia.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/3_ds_4945.asp">Full Story</a>
		</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
