	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="2">Texas Residents Report Hearing a Big Bang About the Time Space Shuttle Apparently Disintegrated</td>
		<td valign="top" rowspan="3" width="95" class="imagecredit8"><a href="/news/data/3_ds_4868.asp"><img src="/dsdsmultimedia/photos/SPACE_SHUTTLE0.jpg" width="85" border="0"></a></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="2" class="citation8">Residents of North Texas said they saw flames and heard a window-rattling boom Saturday about the time the space shuttle Columbia apparently disintegrated on its way to a scheduled landing at Cape Canaveral.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/3_ds_4868.asp">Full Story</a>
		</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
