	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="2">U.K. Prime Minister Blair Downplays Differences With Bush on Securing New U.N. Iraq Resolution</td>
		<td valign="top" rowspan="3" width="95" class="imagecredit8"><a href="/news/data/3_ds_4802.asp"><img src="/dsdsmultimedia/photos/BUSH_US_IRAQ17.jpg" width="85" border="0"></a></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="2" class="citation8">Prime Minister Tony Blair sought to play down differences with the United States on Saturday, emphasizing that both he and President Bush would prefer to secure a United Nations resolution before going to war with Iraq.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/3_ds_4802.asp">Full Story</a>
		</td>
	</tr>
