	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="2">U.S. Reportedly Considers Deploying More Troops to Cope With Nuclear Crisis in North Korea</td>
		<td valign="top" rowspan="3" width="95" class="imagecredit8"><a href="/news/data/3_ds_4323.asp"><img src="/dsdsmultimedia/photos/NORTH_KOREA_KOREAS_N.jpg" width="85" border="0"></a></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="2" class="citation8">South Korean President-elect Roh Moo-hyun planned to dispatch an envoy to Washington early next week, as the United States reportedly contemplated deploying more troops to cope with an increasing nuclear menace from North Korea.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/3_ds_4323.asp">Full Story</a>
