	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="2" class="citation8">Back at the arena where they ended Sacramento's title dreams last spring, the Los Angeles Lakers served notice that they're capable of playing at the level they usually save for the playoffs.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/3_ds_4220.asp">Full Story</a>
